Painting tool in electron.js

install electron first with - "npm install electron --save-dev"

main.js -- file to create window with the app

Public is the main folder of the app.
Folder icons is for toolWheel
JS folder is for js scripts
    script.js - Main part of functions
    colorPicker.js - color picker for selecting color
    color converter - Just for converting between hex and rgb and rgb to hex